CO a comment with $g$ and FORMAT CO
COMMENT another one: $ "unbalanced COMMENT
BEGIN NOTE $ not a format ETON
   { a brief comment { nested } with "}" and $ }
   PR some pragmat with $ PR
   PRAGMAT $ PRAGMAT
   [[ a brief pragmat with $ ]]
   # COUNT and CODE are not CO #
   printf (($g # a comment inside # x CO and another CO g l$, 1, 2))
END
